  "description": "Each YITAMOTOR tonneau cover is custom-built to fit your truck perfectly, ensuring an exact and secure fit. Crafted from high-quality, commercial-grade vinyl, these covers are engineered to withstand the elements, providing durability and long-lasting performance. Unlike other covers, YITAMOTOR tonneau covers will not stretch, fade, or crack, keeping your truck bed protected and looking sharp for years to come.\nFitment\n2019-2026 Dodge Ram 1500 New body style\n5.7 ft beds w/o Rambox and Split Tailgate\nFeatures\nPrecise Compatibility: Designed to fit for Dodge r Ram 1500 New body style 6.4' bed of 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 2025 2026 with 5.7 ft beds w/o Rambox and Split Tailgate, this YITAMOTOR truck bed cover enhances the utility of your vehicle with a custom-fit solution\nReliable and Weather-Resistant: This low-profile truck bed cover provides better scratch and weather resistance, protecting your cargo from rain, snow, dirt, and UV while maintaining its appearance over time\nSmart Quad-Fold Design: Unlike traditional tri-fold covers, this Low-profile hard quad-fold design allows up to 3/4 access to your truck bed. Whether you need to haul bulky toolboxes or outdoor adventure gear, it handles the job with ease-transforming your truck into a versatile hauling powerhouse whenever duty calls\nOne-Handed Operation: No tools, no drilling. Featuring an innovative side-mounted latch, simply pull with one hand and your truck bed opens instantly, just effortless installation. No more walking around your truck anymore to unbuckle the clamps in other side-just faster loading and unloading so you can wrap up the job and hit the road sooner\nMultiple Packages for Your Order: This order will be delivered in 2 separate boxes. Each package has its own tracking ID – check each one for real-time delivery status.",
